  "id": "RAW_cf41343c8c",
  "title": "Kimi Hosted Agents 正式发布：Harness as a Service",
  "url": "https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzcwMjM3ODEzOA==&mid=2247487927&idx=1&sn=6a811d29568ba749ef866f908d1b8d1c",
  "date": "2026-11-05 12:16:00",
  "author": "月之暗面 Kimi",
  "siteName": "月之暗面 Kimi",
  "content": "<html>\n <head></head>\n <body>\n  <p><span>Kimi&nbsp;API</span> <span>2026-11-05 12:16</span> <span style=\"display: inline-block;\">天津</span></p>\n  <p>以下文章来源于：Kimi开放平台</p>\n  <strong>Kimi开放平台</strong>\n  <p>用 Kimi API 创造你的应用：platform.kimi.com ，期待与你一起探索月之暗面</p>\n  <p><img src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261105150259_e6ce94d.jpeg\"></p>\n  <p>Kimi 托管智能体</p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: center;margin-bottom: 24px;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-aistatus=\"1\" data-backh=\"246\" data-backw=\"578\" data-croporisrc=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/mmecoa_png/Sw97icJZE1GzYdzQQGIPsRGRVziath3ibfUKTObZFxswmR3DsW47aDRhdLNlrDdYhzaPZ2aLge1lNN1KKJiaJgicUpZbXLc2f5NmKvSQ5NAE6ZNo/0?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\" data-cropselx1=\"0\" data-cropselx2=\"578\" data-cropsely1=\"0\" data-cropsely2=\"247\" data-imgfileid=\"100001289\" data-ratio=\"0.42578125\" data-s=\"300,640\" style=\"width:100%;\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1280\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261105150302_344504c.png\"></p>\n  <p data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\" style=\"margin-bottom: 24px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\">今天，我们发布 Kimi Hosted Agents（托管智能体），将支撑 Agent 运行的 Harness 作为云端服务提供给企业和开发者，企业无需自行搭建和维护运行框架，即可获得 7×24 小时的托管环境，支持长程任务执行与多智能体高效协作。</span></span></p>\n  <blockquote>\n   <p><span leaf=\"\">开始使用：</span></p>\n   <p><span leaf=\"\">platform.kimi.com/docs/hosted-agents/quickstart</span></p>\n  </blockquote>\n  <p data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\" style=\"margin-bottom: 24px;margin-top: 24px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\">企业可以按需配置 Agent，快速构建两类业务应用：</span></span></p>\n  <ol style=\"list-style-type: decimal;\" class=\"list-paddingleft-1\">\n   <li>\n    <p><strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\">面向内部业务</span></span></strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\">：集成到企业内部系统，提供业务监控、运维响应等任务。</span></span></p>\n   </li>\n   <li>\n    <p><strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\">面向产品用户</span></span></strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\">：嵌入企业对外提供的产品，提供 App 内的投研助手、客服助手等 Agent 服务。</span></span></p>\n   </li>\n  </ol>\n  <p data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\" style=\"margin-bottom: 24px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\">为保障 Agent 安全可控地运行，Kimi Hosted Agents 提供独立沙箱、网络访问权限控制，企业可设定操作边界，并在必要时随时中止会话；执行过程留痕可查，支持审计导出；清晰的计费规则与用量报表，也让企业能够掌握各个 Agent 项目资源消耗与费用。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: center;line-height: 1em;margin-bottom: 0px;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-aistatus=\"1\" data-croporisrc=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/sz_mmecoa_png/Sw97icJZE1GwJJY1dmhVDTOVPsBVUlSWLOOfIpxUCHwt0eyDpV64BbSEc8tsBicIH1GQiaJ04o5Bdablo74T326StM8h0vkvcqkGkKwNO5114U/0?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\" data-cropselx1=\"0\" data-cropselx2=\"578\" data-cropsely1=\"0\" data-cropsely2=\"325\" data-imgfileid=\"100001290\" data-ratio=\"0.5625\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-w=\"1280\" data-type=\"png\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261105150300_e736914.png\"></p>\n  <p data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\" style=\"text-align: center;line-height: 1.6em;margin-bottom: 0px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 14px;color: rgb(136, 136, 136);\">注册登录 platform.kimi.com&nbsp;</span></span><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 14px;color: rgb(136, 136, 136);\">即可体验</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: left;margin: 24px 0px;\"><span leaf=\"\" data-pm-slice=\"1 1 [&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;p&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;data-pm-slice&quot;:&quot;0 0 []&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;,&quot;data-layout-id&quot;:null}]\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 20px;color: rgb(0, 128, 255);font-weight: bold;\">告别自建 Harness，专注业务应用开发</span></span></p>\n  <ul style=\"list-style-type: disc;\" class=\"list-paddingleft-1\"></ul>\n  <p data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\" style=\"margin-bottom: 24px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\">让 Agent 投入生产，企业需要投入几个月构建一套可靠的 Harness 底座 —— 搭建代码执行环境，实现上下文与会话管理、工具调用、权限控制、任务中断恢复等能力。在 Agent 上线后，企业仍需花费大量时间和成本持续维护这套 Harness 系统。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-bottom: 24px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\">现在，依托 Kimi Hosted Agents 提供的 Harness 框架与托管环境，企业可以快速定义任务、接入工具，缩短从原型验证到应用上线的开发周期。底层运行环境的维护与升级由 Kimi 负责，团队无需反复投入基础设施适配与运维，可以更快响应业务需求、迭代应用功能。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: center;margin-bottom: 24px;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"1.3347236704900938\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"959\" type=\"block\" data-imgfileid=\"100001255\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261105150302_d2c493b.png\"></p>\n  <p data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\" style=\"text-align: center;line-height: 1.6em;margin-bottom: 0px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 14px;color: rgb(136, 136, 136);\">自建 Harness vs 使用 Kimi 托管智能体</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: left;margin: 24px 0px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 20px;color: rgb(0, 128, 255);font-weight: bold;\">调</span></span><span leaf=\"\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 20px;color: rgb(0, 128, 255);font-weight: bold;\">用官方 Skills 与插件，加速业务功能开发</span></span></p>\n  <ul style=\"list-style-type: disc;\" class=\"list-paddingleft-1\"></ul>\n  <p data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\" style=\"margin-bottom: 24px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\">Kimi Hosted Agents 提供 140+ Skills 与 30+ 插件，覆盖联网检索、专业数据查询、办公文档处理和内容生成等任务，开发者可按需调用，减少逐项接入工具的开发工作。企业也可接入自有工具和数据源，让智能体适配具体业务流程。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: center;margin-bottom: 24px;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.5625\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1280\" type=\"block\" data-imgfileid=\"100001254\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261105150301_a2a56bc.png\"></p>\n  <p data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\" style=\"text-align: center;line-height: 1.6em;margin-bottom: 0px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 14px;color: rgb(136, 136, 136);\">数据源和插件库仍在持续拓展中</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: left;margin: 24px 0px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 20px;color: rgb(0, 128, 255);font-weight: bold;\">接入 Kimi Inference Hook，让 Agent 在企业安全规则下运行</span></span></p>\n  <ul class=\"list-paddingleft-1\"></ul>\n  <p data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\" style=\"margin-bottom: 24px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\">Kimi Hosted Agents 可结合开放平台的</span></span><strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\">独立安全组件&nbsp;</span></span></strong><strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\">Kimi</span></span></strong><strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\">&nbsp;Inference Hook，对接企业自建或采购的安全服务，</span></span></strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\">在每次模型推理前检查任务输入与工具返回内容，将隐私和敏感数据拦截在推理之前。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: center;margin-bottom: 24px;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.5625\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1280\" data-croporisrc=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/mmecoa_png/Sw97icJZE1GxN1fUE6icCSjTUrF32XeNFia8136kbNXENPv77y9d4MV3c3ETXuX2M3fl4K7ZNluqH7JrDQZicaYL0BdkMrAYJnqJEQk3hymnAaQ/0?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\" data-cropselx1=\"0\" data-cropselx2=\"578\" data-cropsely1=\"0\" data-cropsely2=\"325\" data-imgfileid=\"100001297\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261105150301_fd40dca.png\"></p>\n  <p data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\" style=\"margin-bottom: 24px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\">安全检查规则由企业定义，放行或拒绝由&nbsp;</span></span></strong><strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\">Kimi</span></span></strong><strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\">&nbsp;Inference Hook 执行</span></span></strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\">：只有通过企业安全检查的内容才会进入模型推理。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-bottom: 24px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;color: rgb(136, 136, 136);\">注： Kimi Inference Hook 目前仅针对企业认证用户定向开放，如有业务需求，请联系我们 platform.kimi.com/contact-sales</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: center;margin-bottom: 24px;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.75\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1280\" style=\"width:100%;\" type=\"block\" data-backw=\"543\" data-backh=\"407\" data-imgfileid=\"100001291\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261105150302_b24328f.png\"></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: center;margin-bottom: 24px;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.75\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1280\" style=\"width:100%;\" type=\"block\" data-backw=\"544\" data-backh=\"408\" data-imgfileid=\"100001292\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261105150302_ff728a7.png\"></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: left;margin: 24px 0px;\"><span leaf=\"\" data-pm-slice=\"1 1 [&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;p&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;text-align: left; margin: 24px 0px;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;,&quot;data-layout-id&quot;:null}]\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 20px;color: rgb(0, 128, 255);font-weight: bold;\">官方模板开箱即用，快速构建业务智能体</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-bottom: 24px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\">Kimi 开放平台文档站同步提供配套的 Agent 架构设计思路、配置教程、运行成本估算；企业可将 Agent 模板复制到自己的项目空间，接入内部业务系统、私有数据库等资源，按需调整任务流程，快速构建适合自身业务的智能体。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-bottom: 24px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\">首批提供 8 个金融 Agent 模板，覆盖投研建模、深度研究、晨报生成、IPO 跟踪、持仓监控等任务，支持在托管环境中持续运行。企业可以将 Agent 模板复制到自己的项目空间，接入内部研报、私有数据库等资源，适配实际业务流程。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: center;margin-bottom: 24px;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.5625\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1280\" style=\"width:100%;\" data-croporisrc=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/mmecoa_png/Sw97icJZE1GxIicdtu3cxYh4QAIu7Z7E4nlYtwNA8pfRAP4P3rQP6uq3dqb1anRPeQGLzInzVW9aoY7ccJ8CgJgXyxIad5MMNoQxYjEMIO1N0/0?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\" data-cropselx1=\"0\" data-cropselx2=\"578\" data-cropsely1=\"0\" data-cropsely2=\"325\" data-backw=\"578\" data-backh=\"325\" data-imgfileid=\"100001293\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261105150300_8d6958a.png\"></p>\n  <h3><span leaf=\"\">下面以投研建模、监管例报和基金对账为例，展示 Agent 如何拆解任务、调用工具并完成处理。</span></h3>\n  <div style=\"margin: 24px 8px;\">\n   <div style=\"display: block;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);overflow: scroll hidden;scroll-snap-type: x mandatory;\">\n    <div style=\"display: flex;line-height: 0;font-size: 0px;white-space: nowrap;max-width: none !important;width: 300% !important;\">\n     <div style=\"display: block;scroll-snap-align: start;width: 33.3333%;\">\n      <p style=\"margin-right: 6px;margin-left: 6px;padding: 10px;border: 1px solid rgb(229, 229, 229);border-radius: 8px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" alt=\"投研建模架构图\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"1\" data-w=\"1280\" style=\"display: block;width: 100%;height: auto;border-radius: 4px;\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261105150302_d938dc5.png\"></span></p>\n     </div>\n     <div style=\"display: block;scroll-snap-align: start;width: 33.3333%;\">\n      <p style=\"margin-right: 6px;margin-left: 6px;padding: 10px;border: 1px solid rgb(229, 229, 229);border-radius: 8px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" alt=\"监管判例日报智能体架构图\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"1.004296875\" data-w=\"2560\" style=\"display: block;width: 100%;height: auto;border-radius: 4px;\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261105150301_e7b90d7.png\"></span></p>\n     </div>\n     <div style=\"display: block;scroll-snap-align: start;width: 33.3333%;\">\n      <p style=\"margin-right: 6px;margin-left: 6px;padding: 10px;border: 1px solid rgb(229, 229, 229);border-radius: 8px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" alt=\"基金对账助手架构图\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.91640625\" data-w=\"1280\" style=\"display: block;width: 100%;height: auto;border-radius: 4px;\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261105150301_d6fd962.png\"></span></p>\n     </div>\n    </div>\n   </div>\n   <p style=\"text-align: center;margin-top: 12px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;font-weight: 600;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);\"><span leaf=\"\">→ 右滑查看 Agent 设计与配置架构图</span></span></p>\n  </div>\n  <h3 style=\"text-align: left;margin: 24px 0px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 20px;color: rgb(0, 128, 255);font-weight: bold;\">相关文档</span></span></h3>\n  <p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\">使用指南：Kimi Hosted Agents 快速开始</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-top: 0px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: rgb(136, 136, 136);\">platform.kimi.com/docs/hosted-agents/quickstart</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\">定价说明：Kimi Hosted Agents 定价</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-top: 0px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: rgb(136, 136, 136);\">platform.kimi.com/docs/pricing/hosted-agents</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\">API 说明：Kimi Hosted Agents API 参考</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-top: 0px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: rgb(136, 136, 136);\">platform.kimi.com/docs/api-reference</span></span></p>\n  <div data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\" style=\"margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n   <p data-eleid=\"4\" style=\"min-height: 15px;\"><span data-eleid=\"5\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\">如需更多&nbsp;</span></span></span><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\">Kimi</span></span></span><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\">&nbsp;托管智能体产品支持，请联系我们，并备注「</span></span></span><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\">KHA」：</span></span></span></span></p>\n  </div>\n  <p style=\"text-align: center;margin-bottom: 0px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"1\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"400\" style=\"width:127px;height:127px;\" data-croporisrc=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/sz_mmecoa_png/Sw97icJZE1GyWLmJtY8w20DzlXAiaOGjqlhOqm24uQXddAbnn680tS7PUtFcKcI2tgDeq4dkic60I9iciccQB1LpqMpf5rlBaoK9SmynNPlhDoicU/0?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\" data-cropselx1=\"0\" data-cropselx2=\"121\" data-cropsely1=\"0\" data-cropsely2=\"121\" data-imgfileid=\"100001298\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261105150300_7e2f711.png\"></span></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: center;margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 24px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: rgb(136, 136, 136);font-weight: bold;\">扫描二维码联系我们</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"display: none;\"><mp-style-type data-value=\"3\"></mp-style-type></p>\n  <p><a href=\"https://platform.kimi.com/contact-sales\">阅读原文</a></p>\n </body>\n</html>",
  "aiSummary": "本文宣布 Kimi Hosted Agents（托管智能体）正式发布，企业可通过云端 Harness 服务快速构建面向内部业务或产品用户的 Agent 应用，支持长程任务执行、多智能体协作，并提供独立沙箱、权限控制及计费管理。",
  "oneSentenceSummary": "本文宣布 Kimi Hosted Agents（托管智能体）正式发布，企业可通过云端 Harness 服务快速构建面向内部业务或产品用户的 Agent 应用，支持长程任务执行、多智能体协作，并提供独立沙箱、权限控制及计费管理。",
  "summary": "文章正式发布 Kimi Hosted Agents（托管智能体）服务，将支撑 Agent 运行的 Harness 作为云端服务提供给企业和开发者。企业无需自行搭建和维护运行框架，即可获得 7×24 小时的托管环境，支持长程任务执行与多智能体高效协作。文章阐述了该服务如何帮助企业快速定义任务、接入工具，缩短从原型验证到应用上线的开发周期；底层运行环境的维护与升级由 Kimi 负责。同时介绍了 140+ Skills 与 30+ 插件的能力覆盖范围，企业可按需调用或接入自有工具和数据源。为保障 Agent 安全可控，提供独立沙箱、网络访问权限控制、Inference Hook 安全检查及审计导出功能。首批提供 8 个金融 Agent 模板，支持投研建模、深度研究、晨报生成、IPO 跟踪、持仓监控等任务。",
  "mainPoints": [
    {
      "point": "Kimi Hosted Agents 提供托管 Harness 服务，企业无需自行搭建即可使用 7×24 小时云端环境运行 Agent。",
